<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Bree on Typophile Archive</title><link>http://typophile-archive.simon-cozens.org/tags/bree/</link><description>Recent content in Bree on Typophile Archive</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 16 Feb 2010 09:13:00 +0100</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="http://typophile-archive.simon-cozens.org/tags/bree/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Complement for Bree?</title><link>http://typophile-archive.simon-cozens.org/67467/</link><pubDate>Tue, 16 Feb 2010 09:13:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>http://typophile-archive.simon-cozens.org/67467/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Hi all, I&amp;rsquo;m working on a logotype using &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20131108210909/http:/www.fontshop.com/fonts/downloads/typetogether/bree_complete/"&gt;Bree&lt;/a&gt; and am trying to find a complementary font for use in the rest of the identity package. It&amp;rsquo;s a somewhat unique face so I&amp;rsquo;m thinking maybe something fairly non-descript? I&amp;rsquo;m leaning towards wanting a sans but I&amp;rsquo;m not entirely set on that. Any suggestions very welcome, thanks.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Type in Use: Deco / Font: Bree</title><link>http://typophile-archive.simon-cozens.org/66630/</link><pubDate>Mon, 25 Jan 2010 10:08:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>http://typophile-archive.simon-cozens.org/66630/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="http://web.archive.org/web/20131011065338im_/http:/typophile.com/files/03_5314.jpg" alt=""&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bree was chosen as main typeface for body and titles in Deco, an ethical and ecologically aware French interior magazine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In most cases, the body text actually uses Bree&amp;rsquo;s alternate characters to ensure best legibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It was designed by Ljubomir Djordjevic from the French design studio Commeunarbre.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20131011065338/http:/www.type-together.com/index.php?action=portal/viewContent&amp;amp;cntId_content=2790&amp;amp;id_section=146" title="http://www.type-together.com/index.php?action=portal/viewContent&amp;amp;cntId_content=2790&amp;amp;id_section=146"&gt;http://www.type-together.com/index.php?action=portal/viewContent&amp;amp;cntId_c&amp;hellip;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
